{% block subject %}The attachment's name and its contents do not match{% endblock %}
{% block defect %}The attachment is named as one kind of file, but its contents are of a
different kind — for example a web page or a picture saved with a .pdf name.
For everyone's safety we do not open a file whose contents are not what its
name says.{% endblock %}
{% block remedy %}Please save or export the document again in a standard format and send it
with a matching name: a PDF as .pdf, a photograph as .jpg, a scan as .png or
.jpg. Renaming a file does not change what is inside it, so please export it
again rather than renaming it.{% endblock %}
